# BIT-1's cells after KAWA's: SEL held turns the Pattern page's knobs to the cell's volume, second effect and
# value, and the pattern's rows; SEL held on Song, the position's repeats. SEL let go after a turn does nothing.
wait 500
tap PLAY
wait 200
expect playing 0
expect follow 1
# Follow off (the first song's), so track 1 takes what's written
tap ARP
tap ARP
spin K1 -4
expect par12 0
tap HOME
expect view 0
spin SELECT 2
expect row 2
# SEL held: Volume (K1) to 9, Effect 2 (K2) to Vibrato, Value 2 (K3) to 5
press SEL
spin K1 10
expect vol 10
spin K2 6
spin K3 5
expect fx2 101
wait 200
shot cell_shift.png
release SEL
expect follow 1
# the rows: SEL + K4, sixteen down to twelve
press SEL
spin K4 -4
expect len 12
release SEL
expect follow 1
wait 200
shot rows.png
# the Song page: SEL + K2, the position's repeats
tap SEQ
expect view 1
press SEL
spin K2 2
expect rep 3
wait 200
shot repeats.png
release SEL
# SAVE packs the song; a reboot brings it back
tap SAVE
expect dirty 0
expect packed <3840
reboot
wait 500
expect rep 3
tap HOME
spin SELECT 2
expect vol 10
expect fx2 101
expect len 12
